---
import PillarLayout from '../../layouts/PillarLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---
<PillarLayout slug="cooling">

  <section class="section bg-sand-2" style="padding:clamp(40px,5vw,64px) 0">
    <div class="container pillar-detail__wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow"><Icon name="snowflake" size={15} /> Sized to your home, not a price book</span>
      <h2>Right-sized cooling that actually keeps up</h2>
      <div class="pillar-detail__body">
        <p>An oversized air conditioner short-cycles and never dehumidifies; an undersized one runs flat out and still leaves the house warm. We size the unit to the actual load and the ductwork, so the cooling is even and the equipment lasts. For additions, garages, and rooms the ducts never reached, a ductless mini-split is often the clean answer.</p>
        <p>If your existing AC has stopped cooling, is freezing up, or is making a noise it should not, we diagnose it before recommending anything. Often it is a service call, and we will say so.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PillarLayout>
